        <ul>
          <li>Village: ${esc(cityName()||'—')}</li>
          <li>Returns: ${r.left}' left / ${r.right}' right (cutoff ${braceCutoffFt()}')</li>
          <li>Header through return: ${esc(headerCallout())}</li>
          <li>Sheathing: 7/16" OSB / WSP continuous sill to header</li>
          <li>Hold-down + 1/2" anchors each end of panel (IRC R403.1.6)</li>
          <li>1000 lb strap header to post each side</li>
